// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO33 - dedicated onboard microSD card
// chip-select (SD_SS), not general-purpose.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO15 tagged "led_high" - confirmed onboard single-color LED
// (ESPECTRO32_LED_PIN) in DycodeX's official ESPectro32 library, active-high
// by default (github.com/dycodex/ESPectro32, src/ESPectro32_Constants.h and
// src/ESPectro32_LED.cpp turnOn() -> digitalWrite(pin, HIGH)). Matches LED_BUILTIN.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO27 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard WS2812/Neopixel
// RGB LED (ESPECTRO32_RGBLED_PIN, class ESPectro32_RGBLED : public WS2812) in
// DycodeX's official library (github.com/dycodex/ESPectro32,
// src/ESPectro32_Constants.h, src/ESPectro32_RGBLED.h).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard Button A
// (ESPECTRO32_BUTTON_A_PIN) in DycodeX's official ESPectro32 library
// (github.com/dycodex/ESPectro32, src/ESPectro32_Constants.h, ESPectro32_Board.h).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO4 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard Button B
// (ESPECTRO32_BUTTON_B_PIN) in DycodeX's official ESPectro32 library
// (github.com/dycodex/ESPectro32, src/ESPectro32_Constants.h, ESPectro32_Board.h).
